# danmercede.com — local/dev env example. Copy to `.env.local` (gitignored) to
# experiment locally. In production these are set in the Vercel project, not here.
#
# Google Analytics 4 measurement id (G-XXXXXXXXXX). When set, the <Analytics>
# component loads gtag and tracks page_views (Consent Mode v2: analytics granted,
# ad signals denied, IP anonymized). When UNSET/blank/malformed, analytics is a
# no-op — so dev and preview emit nothing. Must keep the VITE_ prefix to reach
# client code. See docs/runbooks/analytics-observability.md.
VITE_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=
